TSM mp.dll -- reTS's server DLL, built from source
==================================================

What this is
------------

ts\dlls\mp.dll is no longer the shipped reTS release DLL with binary patches applied on top.
It is now built from the reTS source tree: the upstream The Specialists source through
2026-10-29, plus the local changes listed below. The two binary patches this file used to
describe (A, the 81-slot ceiling; B, the powerup grant) are now source changes in that tree.
Their byte-level history is kept as an appendix, for the release pair and for rollback.

